---
// Final CTA — single button, no form, no client JS.
//
// Points at /play (the post-cutover game URL). The current Worker
// renders the game at /, so until the move happens this link 404s.
// See README → cutover blockers.
---

<section class="oh-cta">
  <div class="oh-eyebrow center">&middot;&nbsp; LAUNCH &nbsp;&middot;</div>
  <h2 class="oh-cta-h">
    Try the current build.
    <br />
    <em>Rewrite the rest.</em>
  </h2>
  <p class="oh-cta-sub">
    Choose from 20+ historical, modern, alternate, and fictional presets—or
    write your own start year, nation, and brief. Expect a working prototype,
    not a finished grand-strategy game.
  </p>
  <div class="oh-cta-actions">
    <a href="/play" class="oh-btn-primary oh-btn-primary-lg" data-app-health-event="closing.play.clicked">
      Open the playable prototype <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="oh-cta-fine">
    Held project &middot; playable core loop &middot;
    <a href="https://github.com/sarthakagrawal927/open-historia" class="oh-icon-link" aria-label="GitHub repository" title="GitHub repository" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.013 8.013 0 0016 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg></a>
  </div>
  <footer class="oh-foot">
    <span>&copy; MMXXVI &middot; Open Historia</span>
    <span class="oh-foot-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span>An AI grand-strategy experiment</span>
  </footer>
</section>
